  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Fear Shot\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Fear-shot.jpg\" title=\"Image:Fear-shot.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Fear-shot.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Fear-shot.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Curses\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Ranger\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Causes enemy to have Fear for X seconds and increases attack rating by 300%.\n</td></tr></table><br/>\n<p><b>Fear Shot</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Curses\" title=\"Curses\">Curse skill</a> that causes Fear for X seconds and increases attack rate for 25% within that time. It is commonly used in pvp, because Fear lets the enemy walk to a random direction without being controlled by that player. Within that time there can be made huge amounts of damage. When cast on enemy player, that player will show up yellow.\n</p><p>There is a 5% chance for the Fear effect to be broken if the target takes damage.\n</p><p><b>Cool Down:</b> 7 seconds\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>A ranged attack that causes Fear in your target for X seconds. The attack has an added benefit of 300% to your <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_rating\" title=\"Attack rating\">Attack rating</a>.</b>\n</p>\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">5\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">6\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">7\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">8\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">9\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 10\n</td><td> 20\n</td><td> 30\n</td><td> 40\n</td><td> 50\n</td><td> 60\n</td><td> 70\n</td><td> 80\n</td><td> 90\n</td><td> 100\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">X\n</td><td> 2\n</td><td> 3\n</td><td> 4\n</td><td> 5\n</td><td> 6\n</td><td> 7\n</td><td> 8\n</td><td> 9\n</td><td> 10\n</td><td> 11\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Mana Cost\n</td><td> 44.3\n</td><td> 68.6\n</td><td> 92.9\n</td><td> 117.2\n</td><td> 141.5\n</td><td> 165.8\n</td><td> 190.1\n</td><td> 214.4\n</td><td> 238.7\n</td><td> 263\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 11136\n</td><td> 21228\n</td><td> 32713\n</td><td> 44197\n</td><td> 55681\n</td><td> 67165\n</td><td> 78650\n</td><td> 90134\n</td><td> 101618\n</td><td> 113102\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<table>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
